          {
            "title": "Example: Syntax",
            "id": 91813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij blok kodu tak, aby nie zawierał błędów składni.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"member = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" member \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy Birthday, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + member)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"member\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy Birthday, Jason\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[</code>, następnie <code>]</code>, a potem <code>print</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sprawdź przynależność do listy. Wyświetl <code>Happy Birthday, Jason</code> bez proszenia użytkownika o dane.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"member = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" member \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy Birthday, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + member)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"member\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"input\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy Birthday, Jason\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[</code>, następnie <code>]</code>, <code>print</code>, <code>(</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91806,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dlaczego poniższy kod powoduje błąd <code>IndexError</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"180\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 2, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    scores[5]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indeks jest poza zakresem</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> jest niezdefiniowane</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> nie jest słownikiem</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indeks jest poza zakresem.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które wyrażenie uzyskuje dostęp do ostatniego wyniku, <code>180</code>, bez powodowania <code>IndexError</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"180\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 2, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    scores[5]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scores[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[180]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>scores[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Symbols",
            "id": 91817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Napisz instrukcję, która nie spowoduje błędu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_a = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_b = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team_a &gt; team_b:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Team A won the game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Team A won the game\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>=</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl <code>Team A won the game</code> tylko wtedy, gdy <code>team_a</code> ma wyższy wynik niż <code>team_b</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_a = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_b = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team_a &gt; team_b:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Team A won the game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Team A won the game\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>=</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> i na końcu <code>print</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki typ błędu spowoduje poniższy kod?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"maximum = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &lt; maximum: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;OK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if &quot;50&quot; &lt; maximum:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: &quot;&lt;&quot; not supported between instances of &quot;str&quot; and &quot;int&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>TypeError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>TypeError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co się stanie po uruchomieniu kodu, jeśli zastąpisz <code>\"50\"</code> wartością <code>50</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"maximum = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &lt; maximum: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;OK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if &quot;50&quot; &lt; maximum:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: &quot;&lt;&quot; not supported between instances of &quot;str&quot; and &quot;int&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zakończy działanie bez wyświetlania czegokolwiek.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wyświetli OK.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nadal zgłosi TypeError.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Zgłosi NameError.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zakończy działanie bez wyświetlania czegokolwiek.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W którym miejscu poniższego kodu zostanie zidentyfikowany <code>SyntaxError</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"table_size = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tables_required)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                             ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>guests = 24</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(tables_required)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Który zamiennik trzeciego wiersza usuwa <code>SyntaxError</code> i oblicza liczbę stolików?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"table_size = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tables_required)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                             ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tables_required = guests / table_size</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>tables_required = guests + \"table_size\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tables_required = guests / table_size</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: the `else` keyword",
            "id": 92548,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl komunikat tylko wtedy, gdy można wykonać obliczenie.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"people = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / people\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Your share is \" /><text value=\"{str(share)}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" units.&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"raise\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finally\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your share is 0.5 units.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>pass</code>, następnie <code>else</code> i na końcu <code>prin</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podziel sumę między osoby. Obsłuż niepowodzenie bez zgłaszania błędu i wyświetl wiadomość tylko po pomyślnym wykonaniu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"people = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / people\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Your share is \" /><text value=\"{str(share)}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" units.&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"raise\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finally\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your share is 0.5 units.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>/</code>, następnie <code>pass</code>, <code>else</code> i na końcu <code>print</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Raise an exception",
            "id": 91239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak możemy zgłosić wyjątek, określając komunikat o błędzie?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raise Exception</code>, po którym następuje ciąg znaków zawierający komunikat w nawiasach</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Używanie instrukcji <code>print()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Z użyciem słowa kluczowego <code>except</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raise Exception</code>, po którym następuje ciąg znaków zawierający komunikat w nawiasach.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Komunikat wyjątku definiujemy, umieszczając jego ciąg znaków w <code>raise Exception(...)</code>.</p><p>Który wiersz zgłasza wyjątek z komunikatem <code>Invalid age</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raise Exception(\"Invalid age\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"Invalid age\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except \"Invalid age\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raise Exception(\"Invalid age\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Data validation",
            "id": 91909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki typ błędu możemy zgłosić, jeśli wartość wejściowa nie jest odpowiednia dla naszego programu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Program otrzymuje wiek <code>-4</code>. Dane wejściowe istnieją, ale ich wartość jest nieodpowiednia. Jaki błąd powinien zgłosić program?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError</code>, ponieważ wartość jest nieprawidłowa.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code>, ponieważ zmienna wieku nie ma wartości.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code>, ponieważ dane wejściowe naruszają składnię Pythona.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError</code>, ponieważ wartość jest nieprawidłowa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: the `else` keyword",
            "id": 92542,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetli poniższy blok kodu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trips = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trips += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trips)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Calculation not possible\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Berlin</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetli poniższy blok kodu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trips = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trips += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trips)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Calculation not possible\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Berlin</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>Calculation not possible</code> bez typu wyjątku</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: the `finally` keyword",
            "id": 92550,
